  "description_en": "Retrieves the details of a specified data catalog in DataWorks Data Map. Currently, DLF and StarRocks catalog types are supported",
  "description_zh": "获取数据地图中给定数据目录的详情信息，当前支持dlf与starrocks类型",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dataworks-public get-catalog --id dlf-catalog::catalog_id --api-version 2024-05-18 --region cn-hangzhou",
